        "created_at": "2018-07-21T16:08:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just want to share this lovely moment with you:</p><p>I played using Santa Guise, Stuntman and Benchmark vs. Wager Master.&nbsp;</p><p>It was the turn of Guise and he had a lot of ongoings out which were destroyed at the beginning of his turn. One of that cards was „Uh, Yeah, I‘m that guy!“ which copied all ongoings of &gt;whom may I have chosen&lt; ... correct, it was Stuntman. One of the cards he copied was „Steal the scene“ which got destroyed which led to the following situation: He has stolen his own scene, this silly, hilarious, little guy.&nbsp;</p><p>Right after that „Steal the scene“ of Stuntman triggered. It was like „I will have the last word“ and he dealt the finishing blow.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
