        "created_at": "2018-07-23T05:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, Dark Watch Mr. Fixer also loves both of them ;P</p><p>Stuntman likes to get ongoings destroyed and Benchmark has also a lot of them and may exceed his limit of software cards by 1, just destroy one of them before it‘s his turn again. Aside from this fact, Benchmark has a lot of possibilities to play cards and get them back.&nbsp;</p>",
